  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the squid under cold water, then pat it dry with paper towels.",
    "Cut the squid into small pieces and place them in a large bowl.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Pour the marinade over the squid and toss to coat.",
